<h1>Docs</h1>

<h2 id="quickstart">Quickstart</h2>
<div class="card">
  <p><strong>1.</strong> Install the extension (<a href="#extension">Chrome Web Store / Firefox AMO links</a>) and create a passphrase.</p>
  <p><strong>2.</strong> Log into <a href="https://claude.ai" target="_blank">claude.ai</a> / <a href="https://chatgpt.com" target="_blank">chatgpt.com</a> / <a href="https://gemini.google.com" target="_blank">gemini.google.com</a> in normal browser tabs. The extension auto-syncs.</p>
  <p><strong>3.</strong> Go to <a href="/app">/app</a>, mint a key.</p>
  <p><strong>4.</strong> Drop the key into your tool with base URL <code>https://api.altkey.app/v1</code>.</p>
</div>

<h2>Model name routing</h2>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Prefix</th><th>Routes to</th><th>Examples</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><code>claude-*</code></td><td>Claude</td><td><code>claude-sonnet-4-5</code>, <code>claude-opus-4-5</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>gpt-*</code>, <code>o1</code>, <code>o3</code>, <code>o4-*</code>, <code>chatgpt-*</code></td><td>ChatGPT</td><td><code>gpt-4o</code>, <code>o3</code>, <code>chatgpt-4o-latest</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>gemini-*</code></td><td>Gemini</td><td><code>gemini-2.5-pro</code>, <code>gemini-2.5-flash</code></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

